## OS Kaplan-Meier Curves {#sec-os-km}

::: {.panel-tabset}

### Sample-Based


::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
os_km_data |>
  filter(fit_type == "posterior") |>
  plot_km(
    km_est_var  = sample_os_km_est,
    facet_col   = trial,
    obs_km_data = obs_os_data,
    endpoint    = "os"
  )
```

::: {.cell-output-display}
![Sample-based OS KM (posterior) by trial.](overall-survival_files/figure-html/fig-os-km-sample-1.png){#fig-os-km-sample width=960}
